      "file": "voiceover-01.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 32301,
      "text": "输入一个关键词，AI 帮你生成一条完整的短视频。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4.03
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-02.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 57837,
      "text": "做一条短视频，你要写文案、找素材、配音、剪辑、加字幕，搞下来大半天没了。",
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "start": 4.03,
      "end": 11.26
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-03.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 25965,
      "text": "今天介绍一个阿里开源的项目——Pixelle-Video。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "start": 11.26,
      "end": 14.5
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-04.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 25965,
      "text": "GitHub 将近一万颗星，完全免费。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "start": 14.5,
      "end": 17.74
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-05.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 30957,
      "text": "你只需要输入一个主题，它自动帮你搞定一切。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "start": 17.74,
      "end": 21.6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-06.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 47085,
      "text": "整个流程是这样的：AI 先帮你写文案，支持通义千问、DeepSeek、GPT。",
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "start": 21.6,
      "end": 27.48
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-07.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 35565,
      "text": "然后自动生成配图，用 FLUX 模型画插图。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "start": 27.48,
      "end": 31.92
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-08.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 41901,
      "text": "接着合成语音配音，加上背景音乐，最后直接输出成片。",
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "start": 31.92,
      "end": 37.15
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "file": "voiceover-09.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 11757,
      "text": "全程自动化。",
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "start": 37.15,
      "end": 38.62
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "shot": 5,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-10.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 25965,
      "text": "但这个项目最厉害的地方，是它的架构。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "start": 38.62,
      "end": 41.86
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "shot": 5,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-11.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 30957,
      "text": "它基于 ComfyUI 工作流，每个环节都是独立模块。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "start": 41.86,
      "end": 45.72
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "shot": 5,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-12.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 13101,
      "text": "你想换生图模型？",
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "start": 45.72,
      "end": 47.35
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "shot": 5,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "file": "voiceover-13.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 29229,
      "text": "把 FLUX 换成 Stable Diffusion。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "start": 47.35,
      "end": 51.0
